  "sharpeRatioTitle": "Ratio de Sharpe",
  "sharpeRatioDesc": "Mesure le rendement ajusté au risque. Sharpe > 1 = bon. Sharpe > 2 = excellent.",
  "correlationTitle": "Corrélation des Actifs",
  "correlationConceptTitle": "Coefficient de Corrélation",
